-- rows 필드: country(지역소계=null), attrType, values(periodKeys 순서 정렬 배열)  ※ rowKind/rowKey/order는 country/배열순서에서 파생
-- =============================================================================

DELETE FROM tmd_mdl_scnrcasevolrgnl WHERE run_seq = 2 AND sgmt_cd = 'LNG' AND perd_unit_spt_cd = 'Y';

